Problems & controversies regarding the test & the MINDACT trial Technical challenges
There are several technical challenges regarding the use of Mammaprint. As proliferation rate is a continuous variable, there must be a trade-off in each cut-point used between the amount of patients spared of adjuvant systemic treatment and the proportion who may relapse in the future. It must be emphasized that the cut-point used for risk-classification applies to western populations and usually splits the population in half in terms of
