Cost–effectiveness of Mammaprint
Despite its utility, Mammaprint carries logistic and cost issues. Even if it can now be performed in formalin-fixed paraffin-embedded tissue, it is still a centralized test to be performed by Agendia, meaning that hospitals have to ship their samples to The Netherlands or to the USA, increasing the turnaround time for obtaining results. The
